---
source: crates/qry/src/cli_tests.rs
expression: help.to_string()
---
A terminal SQL client for PostgreSQL, MySQL, MariaDB, SQLite and Oracle

Usage: qry [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -t, --tick-rate <FLOAT>
          Tick rate, i.e. number of ticks per second
          
          [default: 4]

  -f, --frame-rate <FLOAT>
          Frame rate, i.e. number of frames per second
          
          [default: 60]

      --theme <NAME>
          Colour theme; overrides the config's "theme"
          
          [possible values: dark]

      --print-config
          Print the config in effect (the defaults with your files over them) in the config's
          format, and exit

  -h, --help
          Print help

  -V, --version
          Print version
